  "description": {
    "text": "In 2008 Pokémon USA and Burger King ran a promotion at Burger King restaurants around the world: each BK Kids Meal came with a Pokémon TCG card and an accessory, and these restaurants were the only place to get each of the 12 cards. It was announced to run from 7 July to 3 August 2008 in the US and through the late summer and fall in other countries. Each card reprints a Diamond & Pearl or Mysterious Treasures card, keeping its number, in reverse holo with the Diamond & Pearl logo stamped on the bottom right of its picture.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "PocketMonsters.net: Pokemon USA and Burger King Corp. Partner for Global Promotion in 2008 (the press release)",
        "url": "https://pocketmonsters.net/news/27"
      },
